<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES FROM PGA ST JUDE CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES FROM PGA ST JUDE CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final leading</p>
<p>scores from the $1.5 million St Jude Classic, won by Greg</p>
<p>Norman on Sunday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>268 Greg Norman (Australia) 68-65-69-66</p>
<p>269 Dudley Hart 69-68-66-66</p>
<p>270 Craig Parry (Australia) 69-69-66-66, Robert Damron</p>
<p>65-66-69-70</p>
<p>271 Justin Leonard 66-71-65-69, Michael Bradley 68-67-66-70,</p>
<p>Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 66-68-68-69, Jay Don Blake 70-64-68-69</p>
<p>272 Tom Byrum 69-69-67-67, Mike Hulbert 67-67-67-71, Gene</p>
<p>Sauers 65-67-70-70</p>
<p>273 Kenny Perry 66-71-70-66, Robert Gamez 71-65-72-65, Steve</p>
<p>Lowery 72-68-70-73</p>
<p>274 Phil Blackmar 69-67-73-65</p>
<p>275 Michael Christie 70-68-65-72, Stewart Cink 68-71-68-68,</p>
<p>Fuzzy Zoeller 69-67-70-69, David Toms 69-70-71-65, Andrew</p>
<p>Magee 68-67-69-71, Jack O'Keefe 69-66-70-70</p>
<p>276 Brian Claar 68-71-67-70, John Adams 70-66-69-71, Skip</p>
<p>Kendall 68-67-74-67, Bob Estes 68-66-72-70, Dan Forsman</p>
<p>69-69-68-71</p>
</text>
